ify left)) (uuid 9b42e91e-bead-4b8b-afa7-f94f9c03745a)) (text "Amp: gain = 1 + R8/R9 = 34 (SPICE: 32.8 at 2.8 kHz), band 0.7-26 kHz (-3 dB) then R10/C9 anti-alias 7.2 kHz, VMID = VCC/2 with 10 uF bypass so the feedback return is low impedance." (at 20 279 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 489f7807-67c4-4242-88dd-eafaa0f04c29)) (text "Q2 (AO3401A): drain=battery side, source=load, gate=GND: blocks reversed batteries." (at 20 286 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid d36b6d11-0b50-48bf-9f07-c3129cfd519b)) (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))